    "expectedRule": "Entropy Ark tracks entropy 0-4, starting at 2/4. Clearing the bow, midship or stern heading console opens a pending heading for that console; while pending the law display shows 待选航 and departure is blocked until the player chooses steady (entropy -1, or -2 with dissipation_mantle) or rush (entropy +1), logging 方舟航向·稳航/抢航：熵值 ±N，当前熵值 N/4。 and recording the choice in resolvedHeadingChoices. Clearing a monster or trap (except the last_helmsman boss) raises entropy by 1 (the entropy_compass passive negates the first such increase once); clearing a reward node lowers entropy by 1. Route gates ark_bow_dissipation_lane and ark_midship_dissipation_lane open only at entropy at most 1; ark_bow_port_relic_lane and ark_midship_starboard_relic_lane only at entropy at least 3; ark_manifest_helmsman_lane only between 1 and 3; closed gates expose their real block reason (熵值需降至 N 或以下。/熵值需升至 N 或以上。/熵值需保持在 N 至 M 之间。) and remove the edge from legal adjacent targets, so run/move through a closed gate is rejected illegal-move. Threshold modifiers: entropy at most 1 gives enemy defense +(2-entropy)*10%; entropy at least 3 gives trap damage/dc +(entropy-2)*10%, non-boss enemy allStats +(entropy-2)*10% and outgoing force/art +(entropy-2)*10%. Starting the last_helmsman boss combat locks the entropy, clears the pending heading and mints collapseLayers = clamp(|entropy - 2| - ark_keel_boots, 0, 2); the boss gains allStats +10% per collapse layer, the display shows 熵值 N/4，已锁定，崩解层 N and the layers persist through and after the fight. Display severity is danger at collapseLayers 2 or entropy 0/4, resolved only when entropy is 2 with no pending heading and no collapse layers, otherwise warning. Heading choices are unavailable at the 0/4 boundaries (熵值已达 0/4，无法继续稳航降熵。/熵值已达 4/4，无法继续抢航升熵。) and with no pending heading (当前没有待指定的方舟航向。). Law state persists through a save-codec round-trip. Re-selecting a cleared console is rejected already-resolved without changing law state or HP. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
